 ar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#eswc-2027\nNotes: Official sit
 e: 24th ESWC\, May 23-27\, 2027\, St. Raphael Resort & Marina\, Limassol\
 ; workshops/tutorials May 23-24. All deadlines 23:59 AoE. Research\, Reso
 urces and In-Use tracks share a mandatory Dec 10 abstract and Dec 17 pape
 r (15 pages\, Springer LNCS)\; rejected ISWC 2026 research papers may res
 ubmit (commitment date TBA). Posters/demos (LNCS)\, industry abstracts (n
 eeds a non-academic author) and single-author PhD papers go to satellite 
 proceedings\; poster and PhD dates are marked subject to change. Named Eu
 ropean again since 2026 (Extended 2010-2025)\; now overseen by SWSA. Annu
 al since 2004. ESWC 2026 accepted 28 research\, 17 resource and 10 in-use
  papers. Size is an editorial estimate.
